## 7. Technical Skills (0-15 points)

Full-stack breadth matters for this role — weight breadth across the stack, not
just depth in a single layer.

**HIGH (11-15):** demonstrated breadth across frontend, backend, and
data/infrastructure layers, evidenced in projects or work — not just a bare
skills list

**MEDIUM (6-10):** solid skills concentrated in one or two layers of the stack

**LOW (1-5):** narrow, generic, or unverified skill listing with little
supporting evidence elsewhere in the resume

**ZERO (0):** no meaningful technical skills evidence

