## 8. Bonus Points (maximum 20 points total, stated here only)

- **+2** — personal portfolio/website URL present in `basics.url`
- **+1** — GitHub profile URL present (only if distinct from the portfolio link
  above)
- **+1** — LinkedIn profile present
- **+2 to +3** — early-stage engineer experience (first 10-20 employees at a
  startup)
- **+1 to +3** — high-quality technical blogs, if blog data is provided (regular
  posting, diverse technical topics)

**Explicitly excluded:** participation in competitive open-source fellowship
programs (Google Summer of Code, Outreachy, Girl Script Summer of Code, Season
of Docs) does not earn bonus points. These are themselves selective admissions
processes and would reintroduce the access bias this rubric is designed to
avoid.

This 20-point cap is absolute regardless of how many of the above are satisfied.

